# PlanningWorkspace - Repository Reference

`<workspace>` below refers to the Workspace path from `## Configuration` in the parent `CLAUDE.md`.

This folder holds shared, read-only clones of all repos referenced by the dev workflow. It is updated before planning phases by `/work` Phase 1.

**Rules:**
- READ ONLY — never modify files in this folder
- Never switch branches
- Never commit or push
- Always on the `main` branch

**Update command (run before planning):**
```bash
cd <workspace>/PlanningWorkspace
for dir in */; do (cd "$dir" && git fetch origin && git reset --hard origin/main); done
```

## Quick Reference: Which Repo?

| Task | Repo | Start Here |
|------|------|------------|
| Add API endpoint | NextGenOrig | Find existing endpoint in same feature area |
| Add database query | NextGenOrig | Find existing DataProvider in same feature |
| Add UI page/component | Gateway.Web / CustomerEngagement.Web / ClientPortal.Sidecar.Web | Find similar page in `Features/` folder |
| Add HTTP client method | NextGenOrig (defines), Blazor apps (consume) | Find existing method in `ApiHttpClient` |

